[
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "知识梳理与例题",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            304,
            93,
            438,
            111
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "一、向量的概念、向量组的概念",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            336,
            129,
            628,
            148
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "定义n个数 $a_{1},a_{2},\\cdots,a_{n}$ 所组成的有序数组",
        "bbox": [
            336,
            167,
            705,
            184
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/1cea390f5652a295a5f837218a158b0446c003a9721f6ef96474404a698426e1.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "bbox": [
            16,
            330,
            70,
            444
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "img_path": "images/461f90aa58c267e4be3b1c4434973f90576db248c4d0757b155d2d11664f9894.jpg",
        "text": "$$\n\\boldsymbol{\\alpha} = (a_{1}, a_{2}, \\cdots, a_{n})^{\\mathrm{T}}  或  \\boldsymbol{\\alpha} = (a_{1}, a_{2}, \\cdots, a_{n})\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            396,
            191,
            759,
            209
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "叫做n维向量，其中 $a_{1}, a_{2}, \\cdots, a_{n}$ 叫做向量α的分量(或坐标)，前一个表示式称为列向量，后者称为行向量.",
        "bbox": [
            295,
            215,
            858,
            256
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "相等 $\\alpha = \\beta \\Leftrightarrow \\alpha,\\beta$ 同维，且对应分量 $a_{i}=b_{i},i=1,2,\\cdots,n$",
        "bbox": [
            334,
            263,
            838,
            280
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "向量的基本运算",
        "bbox": [
            334,
            288,
            472,
            305
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "加法 $\\boldsymbol{\\alpha} + \\boldsymbol{\\beta} = (a_{1} + b_{1}, a_{2} + b_{2}, \\cdots, a_{n} + b_{n})$",
        "bbox": [
            334,
            311,
            704,
            329
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "数乘 $k \\boldsymbol{\\alpha} = (k a_{1}, k a_{2}, \\cdots, k a_{n})$",
        "bbox": [
            334,
            335,
            589,
            351
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "若干个同维数的行向量(或同维数的列向量）所组成的集合叫做 向量组.",
        "bbox": [
            295,
            359,
            862,
            399
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$\\alpha_{1}, \\alpha_{2}, \\cdots, \\alpha_{r}$ 及 $\\alpha_{1}, \\alpha_{2}, \\cdots, \\alpha_{r}, \\cdots, \\alpha_{s}$ (其中 $s \\geqslant r )$ ,称 $\\alpha_{1}, \\alpha_{2}, \\cdots, \\alpha_{r}$ 是 $\\alpha_{1}, \\alpha_{2}, \\cdots, \\alpha_{s}$ 的部分组， $\\alpha_{1}, \\alpha_{2}, \\cdots, \\alpha_{s}$ 是整体组.",
        "bbox": [
            295,
            407,
            862,
            448
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "向量组",
        "bbox": [
            336,
            454,
            396,
            469
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "img_path": "images/c98f874ae45e6ebd9be6b4071bf2ee484f5b777789d451b73b5689767826346e.jpg",
        "text": "$$\n\\boldsymbol { \\alpha } _ { 1 } = \\left[ a _ { 1 1 } , a _ { 2 1 } , \\cdots , a _ { r 1 } \\right] ^ { \\mathrm { T } } , \\boldsymbol { \\alpha } _ { 2 } = \\left[ a _ { 1 2 } , a _ { 2 2 } , \\cdots , a _ { r 2 } \\right] ^ { \\mathrm { T } } , \\cdots ,\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            332,
            476,
            768,
            495
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "img_path": "images/e5ee4db67083075c07ff5152e7d98703b20ef581c65e0b8b697b3a942d4e64c6.jpg",
        "text": "$$\n\\boldsymbol{a}_{m}=[a_{1m}, a_{2m}, \\cdots, a_{m}]^{\\mathrm{T}}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            332,
            500,
            541,
            519
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "及",
        "bbox": [
            295,
            525,
            321,
            541
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "img_path": "images/737a83b30cf3b7ff01608e1e055abb55d34baee188fd36e4a59ae27feb9abe8b.jpg",
        "text": "$$\n\\tilde { \\boldsymbol { \\alpha } } _ { 1 } = [ a _ { 1 1 } , a _ { 2 1 } , \\cdots , a _ { r 1 } , \\cdots , a _ { r 1 } ] ^ { \\mathrm { T } } , \\tilde { \\boldsymbol { \\alpha } } _ { 2 } = [ a _ { 1 2 } , a _ { 2 2 } , \\cdots , a _ { r 2 } , \\cdots , a _ { r 2 } ] ^ { \\mathrm { T } } ,\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            331,
            546,
            857,
            567
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "img_path": "images/b5c416baab067263a37387a8863fd71e64d13d86ad3a5dc382d5617931c16e49.jpg",
        "text": "$$\n\\cdots , \\boldsymbol { \\alpha } _ { m } = [ a _ { 1 m } , a _ { 2 m } , \\cdots , a _ { m } , \\cdots , a _ { m } ] ^ { \\mathrm { T } } ,\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            295,
            574,
            600,
            593
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "其中 $s \\geqslant r ,$ 则称 $\\widetilde{\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}}_{1}, \\widetilde{\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}}_{2}, \\cdots, \\widetilde{\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}}_{m}$ 为向量组 $\\alpha_{1}, \\alpha_{2}, \\cdots, \\alpha_{m}$ 的延伸组(或称$\\alpha_{1}, \\alpha_{2}, \\cdots, \\alpha_{m}$ 是 $\\tilde{\\alpha}_{1}, \\tilde{\\alpha}_{2}, \\cdots, \\tilde{\\alpha}_{m}$ 的缩短组).",
        "bbox": [
            295,
            601,
            862,
            646
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "二、线性表出、线性相关",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            334,
            663,
            559,
            682
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "定义m个n维向量 $\\alpha_{1}, \\alpha_{2}, \\cdots, \\alpha_{m}$ 及m个数 $k_{1},k_{2},\\cdots,k_{m}$ ,则向量",
        "bbox": [
            336,
            701,
            862,
            717
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "img_path": "images/e62bd0a84ab717195f3614fd5894c7e16f936890a9b9358a89c25f81c01a9fc0.jpg",
        "text": "$$\nk_{1} \\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1} + k_{2} \\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2} + \\cdots + k_{m} \\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{m}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            473,
            725,
            682,
            740
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "称为向量 $\\alpha_{1}, \\alpha_{2}, \\cdots, \\alpha_{m}$ 的一个线性组合 $k_{1},k_{2},\\cdots,k_{m}$ 称为这个线性组合的系数.",
        "bbox": [
            295,
            747,
            862,
            787
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "若 $\\pmb { \\beta }$ 能表示成 $\\alpha_{1}, \\alpha_{2}, \\cdots, \\alpha_{m}$ 的线性组合，即",
        "bbox": [
            332,
            795,
            695,
            812
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "img_path": "images/9bba6e43e647abdee5b94971d4a7c6037f6f48c00feaf1bea3164ad3cf05d82d.jpg",
        "text": "$$\n\\boldsymbol { \\beta } = k _ { 1 } \\boldsymbol { \\alpha } _ { 1 } + k _ { 2 } \\boldsymbol { \\alpha } _ { 2 } + \\cdots + k _ { m } \\boldsymbol { \\alpha } _ { m }   ,\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            448,
            819,
            705,
            835
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "则称 $\\beta$ 能由 $\\alpha_{1}, \\alpha_{2}, \\cdots, \\alpha_{m}$ 线性表出.",
        "bbox": [
            297,
            841,
            593,
            858
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "定义对m个n维向量 $\\alpha_{1}, \\alpha_{2}, \\cdots, \\alpha_{m}$ ，若存在不全为零的数 $k_{1}$ $k_{2},\\cdots,k_{m}$ ,使得",
        "bbox": [
            295,
            865,
            857,
            904
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "img_path": "images/9f25bb792e6faf6a4a762d3b19394cc5152a632451a744412cc7891a104abc2e.jpg",
        "text": "$$\nk_{1} \\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1} + k_{2} \\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2} + \\cdots + k_{m} \\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{m} = \\boldsymbol{0}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            453,
            912,
            704,
            928
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
